  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Add CFG007, a warning for unknown appsettings keys that will throw when a supported binding call explicitly leaves BinderOptions.ErrorOnUnknownConfiguration enabled; reuse CFG006's bindable-property model for strict BindConfiguration, Bind(GetSection(...)), and direct Configure(GetSection(...)) shapes while preserving conservative guards for non-final strict options, constructor/helper/local-helper/delegate-Invoke/non-local-alias escapes, open or polymorphic value shapes, empty collection-expression dictionaries, keys accepted by the strict runtime binder, constructor-assigned dictionary comparers, generic equality-comparer aliases, creatable reference collection and dictionary item members, nested dictionary paths with per-level case-insensitive comparers, and CFG006 fallback visibility when CFG007 is disabled through compilation diagnostic suppression.",
